You are building the official website for Nixon Tours, a premium family-owned tourism agency in Panama specializing in Guna Yala island tours.

PROJECT PERSONALITY:
The website must feel premium, tropical, modern, trustworthy, clean, dynamic and conversion-focused. Never make it look generic, cheap, cluttered or like a basic template.

BRAND RULES:
Use Nixon Tours branding consistently.

Primary font:
- Inter

Brand colors:
- Neon cyan: #00D4FF
- Violet: #8B5CF6
- Tropical green: #10B981
- Deep navy: #0f172a
- Corporate blue: #1e3a5f
- Slate: #334155
- Text gray: #475569
- Light background: #F8FAFC
- White: #FFFFFF
- Sand gold: #F4C542

Preferred gradients:
- #00D4FF to #8B5CF6
- #667eea to #764ba2
- Deep navy to cyan

Logo rule:
Never redesign or alter the official Nixon Tours logo. Use the provided logo only. Keep it clean, visible and professional.

VISUAL STYLE:
Use:
- Large island photography
- Rounded corners
- Soft shadows
- Smooth animations
- Premium spacing
- Modern cards
- Clean typography
- Clear CTAs
- Tropical but professional visuals

Avoid:
- Overcrowded layouts
- Too many colors at once
- Generic stock template feeling
- Poor spacing
- Low contrast
- Unreadable text over images
- Excessive animations

TECH STACK:
Use:
- Next.js App Router
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- Supabase
- Shadcn UI
- Framer Motion
- React Hook Form
- Zod
- Lucide React

CODE QUALITY:
- Write clean, modular and scalable code.
- Use reusable components.
- Keep files organized.
- Use TypeScript types.
- Avoid duplicated logic.
- Validate all forms.
- Handle loading, error and empty states.
- Use environment variables for secrets.
- Do not hardcode dynamic tourism data when it should come from Supabase.
- Keep the project mobile-first and responsive.

PUBLIC WEBSITE ROUTES:
Create:
- /
- /paquetes
- /paquetes/[slug]
- /islas
- /islas/[slug]
- /galeria
- /nosotros
- /contacto
- /cotizar

ADMIN ROUTES:
Create protected admin area:
- /admin
- /admin/login
- /admin/dashboard
- /admin/cotizaciones
- /admin/paquetes
- /admin/paquetes/nuevo
- /admin/paquetes/[id]/editar
- /admin/islas
- /admin/islas/nueva
- /admin/islas/[id]/editar
- /admin/configuracion

DATABASE TABLES:
Use Supabase with these tables:
- islands
- packages
- quotes
- site_settings

ISLANDS TABLE:
Fields:
- id
- name
- slug
- description
- main_image_url
- gallery
- is_active
- created_at
- updated_at

PACKAGES TABLE:
Fields:
- id
- island_id
- name
- slug
- type
- price
- duration
- short_description
- long_description
- includes
- excludes
- itinerary
- recommendations
- policies
- main_image_url
- gallery
- is_active
- created_at
- updated_at

QUOTES TABLE:
Fields:
- id
- full_name
- whatsapp
- email
- nationality
- island_id
- package_id
- package_type
- travel_date
- adults
- children
- needs_transport
- comments
- status
- created_at

SITE SETTINGS TABLE:
Fields:
- id
- whatsapp
- email
- instagram
- facebook
- address
- logo_url
- hero_title
- hero_subtitle
- created_at
- updated_at

INITIAL DATA:
Seed these islands:
- Isla Naranjo Chico
- Isla Senidub
- Isla Pelícano
- Isla Pugsub
- Isla Diablo
- Isla Perro Chico
- Isla Perro Grande

Seed Isla Naranjo Chico packages:
- Estadía: $135
- Pasadía: $95
- Camping: $125

CONTENT TONE:
Use Spanish as the main language.
Tone should be:
- Professional
- Friendly
- Trustworthy
- Tropical
- Clear
- Persuasive

Avoid exaggerated or fake promises.

CTA STYLE:
Use strong CTAs:
- Cotizar mi viaje
- Ver paquetes
- Reservar por WhatsApp
- Quiero conocer Guna Yala
- Solicitar información

WHATSAPP:
Main WhatsApp:
+507 6825-2312

Always generate clean WhatsApp links using:
https://wa.me/50768252312

Quote messages must include:
- Name
- Island
- Package type
- Travel date
- Adults
- Children
- Transport
- Comments

SEO RULES:
Optimize pages for:
- Tours a Guna Yala
- Paquetes Guna Yala
- Pasadía Guna Yala
- Camping Guna Yala
- Islas de San Blas
- Isla Naranjo Chico
- Isla Perro Chico
- Isla Diablo
- Turismo en Panamá

Every public page must have:
- Metadata title
- Metadata description
- Clean slug
- Semantic HTML
- Good heading hierarchy

ADMIN PANEL RULES:
Admin must be simple, clean and functional.
Admin must allow:
- View quotes
- Update quote status
- Delete quotes
- Create packages
- Edit packages
- Delete packages
- Activate/deactivate packages
- Create islands
- Edit islands
- Delete islands
- Upload images
- Update site settings

Quote statuses:
- nueva
- contactado
- reservado
- cancelado

COMPONENT RULES:
Create reusable components:
- Navbar
- Footer
- HeroSection
- PackageCard
- IslandCard
- QuoteForm
- WhatsAppButton
- CTASection
- GalleryGrid
- TestimonialCard
- AdminSidebar
- AdminHeader
- StatsCard
- DataTable
- ImageUploader
- PackageForm
- IslandForm
- StatusBadge

UX RULES:
The site must be easy to use.
The quote process must be simple.
Mobile experience must be excellent.
Buttons must be visible.
Forms must be short but complete.
Images must sell the experience.
Admin must be fast and practical.

SECURITY RULES:
- Protect admin routes.
- Use Supabase Auth.
- Use row level security where appropriate.
- Never expose private keys.
- Validate all user input.
- Sanitize form data.
- Use environment variables.

FINAL GOAL:
Build a complete, premium, dynamic and scalable tourism website for Nixon Tours that can grow as more islands and packages are added from the admin panel.